\pard\tx2380\b0\fs28\fi-1960\li2380\fc0\cf0 DESCRIPTION	
\b DPSAddFD()
\b0  registers the function
\i  handler
\i0  to be called each time there is activity with the file specified by file descriptor 
\i fd
