\fs20 \

\pard\tx2760\tx3140\tx3520\fs28\fi-380\li2760\fc0\cf0 ·	The file descriptor 
\i fd
\i0  must be valid and open; typically 
\i fd
\i0  is generated through a call to 
\b open()
\b0 .  There needn't be any data waiting to be read on 
\i fd
\i0 .\

\fs20 \

\fs28 ·	
\i priority
\i0 , an integer from 0 to 30, must be equal to or greater than the application's current priority threshold.  See 
\b DPSAddTimedEntry()
\b0  for a further explanation.\

