\fs20 \

\pard\f0\fs28\li2380\fc0\cf0 Warning:  Be careful when you use this function; you mustn't send more PostScript code€while waiting for the handler to be called.  In general, it's best to not make any demands on the Application Kit or the Client Library if you're waiting for an asynchronous handler to return.\

